<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER SECOND ROUND OF BUICK CHALLENGE.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER SECOND ROUND OF BUICK CHALLENGE.</headline>
<dateline>PINE MOUNTAIN, Georgia 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>after the second round of the $1 million Buick Challenge on</p>
<p>Friday, played on the 7,057-yard, par-72 Callaway Gardens</p>
<p>course (players U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>134 Fred Funk 69 65, John Maginnes 68 66, Davis Love 66 68,</p>
<p>Michael Bradley 66 68, Len Mattiace 66 68</p>
<p>135 Brad Faxon 69 66, Fred Couples 68 67, Marco Dawson 70 65</p>
<p>136 Stewart Cink 66 70, Brad Bryant 68 68</p>
<p>137 Bobby Wadkins 64 73, Willie Wood 69 68, Hal Sutton 71 66</p>
<p>138 Olin Browne 66 72, Guy Boros 68 70, Neal Lancaster 69 69,</p>
<p>Jim McGovern 65 73, Jerry Kelly 70 68, Jim Furyk 69 69</p>
<p>Other foreigners:</p>
<p>140 Craig Parry (Australia) 70 70, Steve Elkington</p>
<p>(Australia) 68 72</p>
<p>142 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 73 69</p>
<p>144 Fulton Allem (South Africa) 74 70, Denis Watson</p>
<p>(Zimbabwe) 73 71</p>
<p>145 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 75 70</p>
<p>147 Steve Rintoul (Australia) 74 73, Stuart Appleby</p>
<p>(Australia) 74 73</p>
<p>148 Lucas Parsons (Australia) 74 74</p>
<p>149 Alexander Cejka (Germany) 76 73</p>
<p>151 Brad Hughes (Australia) 77 74</p>
